  "2026-05-29T21:59:11.833Z",codex,"2026-05-29 functional readiness audit evidence.\n\nPackage checks from /home/steve/container/pm-graph:\n- `npm run check`: exit 0, 6s.\n- `npm test`: exit 0, 14s; TAP reported `# tests 2`, `# pass 2`, `# fail 0`.\n- `npm run pack:dry-run`: exit 0, 15s; tarball `pm-graph-2026.5.28.tgz`, package size 17.6 kB, unpacked size 73.9 kB, total files 8.\n- `npm run changelog:check`: exit 0, 1s; `Changelog is up to date: /home/steve/container/pm-graph/CHANGELOG.md`.\n\nHands-on test used temporary workspace `/tmp/pm-core-audit-20260529/workspaces/pm-graph.*` with local install `pm install /home/steve/container/pm-graph`.\n- Created parent/child/blocked-by items with real-looking non-sensitive data: `Launch data quality program`, `Implement lineage crawler`, and `Validate import replay safety`.\n- `pm --json pm-graph ping`: exit 0; returned `ok: true`, `neo4jConfigured: false`.\n- `pm --json pm-graph export`: exit 0.\n- `pm --json pm-graph cypher`: exit 0; returned graph summary `nodes: 11`, `relationships: 14`.\n- Verification `pm --json pm-graph export | jq -e '.ok == true and (.graph.nodes | length) >= 3 and (.graph.relationships | length) >= 2'`: exit 0.\n\nSensitive-data scan:\n- Current tracked files and git history scanned without printing matching values using pattern classes `private_key`, `provider_token`, `secret_assignment`, and `email_address`.\n- No matches found for pm-graph.\n\nBlockers: none found for pm-graph."
  "2026-05-29T22:33:28.947Z",codex,"2026-05-29 release-readiness refresh: package manifest/lock now target @unbrained/pm-cli >=2026.5.29 / ^2026.5.29 and pm-changelog ^2026.5.29-2 where applicable. Verified npm run check, npm test, npm run pack:dry-run, npm run audit:prod, npm run changelog:full, npm run changelog:check, npm run release:check, and pm validate. High-confidence worktree/history secret scan recorded no credential-shaped token findings for active package code; nonzero scan rows were classified as placeholders or vendored historical test data where applicable. Logs: /tmp/pm-active-package-gates-20260529.tsv, /tmp/pm-active-changelog-20260529.tsv, /tmp/pm-active-release-check-20260529.tsv, /tmp/pm-active-validate-20260529.tsv, /tmp/pm-active-secret-scan-20260529.tsv."
